{"title":"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(quick_and_easy)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (quick and easy)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the correct ordering of the three numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/2/532a7d21d6914b742efc7e65443dcea6173d0a3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/c/89cb8ea0947d613d3ba24dff185018ca468851bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/f/7ffad955f99e6fe4b457ad9454f5c6f1284a0358.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />, in increasing order?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/a/b1a24c5b8cbeac396ff52f42f24199f169b807de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\hspace{.05in}\\frac{9}{23}&lt;\\frac{7}{21}&lt;\\frac{5}{19}\\quad\\textbf{(B)}\\hspace{.05in}\\frac{5}{19}&lt;\\frac{7}{21}&lt;\\frac{9}{23}\\quad\\textbf{(C)}\\hspace{.05in}\\frac{9}{23}&lt;\\frac{5}{19}&lt;\\frac{7}{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"481\" height=\"38\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/b/dbb80b495062e1d2fc187696945d270c2a6d219f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}\\hspace{.05in}\\frac{5}{19}&lt;\\frac{9}{23}&lt;\\frac{7}{21}\\quad\\textbf{(E)}\\hspace{.05in}\\frac{7}{21}&lt;\\frac{5}{19}&lt;\\frac{9}{23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"314\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/c/89cb8ea0947d613d3ba24dff185018ca468851bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />. Now we give all the fractions a common denominator.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/b/deb82d8e0d9562630572bf3caaa30daa04b4850d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{19} \\implies \\frac{345}{1311}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/7/a57be2c44eec8d837669eb6c69dfc8e7734ec4da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3} \\implies \\frac{437}{1311}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"105\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/e/95ee769e8b51aaf1744ec7e192c21848c0c9950c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{23} \\implies \\frac{513}{1311}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Ordering the fractions from least to greatest, we find that they are in the order listed. Therefore, our final answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2dd3030cba2aa9b1cc56249863554d3d4996b902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{5}{19}&lt;\\frac{7}{21}&lt;\\frac{9}{23}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"160\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Change <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/d/0cd5e08a4d780d68e621b07b15783437048fbb2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7/21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/7/217aedbdc339bacc8ba075a2ec16902b098194e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1/3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"20\" />;\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/f/51ff65c8d23f72a31b94d65d657981c33a23753e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot\\frac{5}{5}=\\frac{5}{15}\\]\" width=\"82\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/d/aed69704eee407e6b45f914272f14f9fbda8dcd7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{5}{15}&gt;\\frac{5}{19}\\]\" width=\"65\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/1/991bcb813a14be818141a0aeed6dff7b78e7fe87.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{7}{21}&gt;\\frac{5}{19}\\]\" width=\"65\" height=\"38\" />\nAnd\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/c/37cfd4a051dc8159cd0ef6c5511ecdd185d8ff1e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot\\frac{9}{9}=\\frac{9}{27}\\]\" width=\"82\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/2/282cce073d0e86fb997b827ff33b7e25e26a8721.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{9}{27}&lt;\\frac{9}{23}\\]\" width=\"65\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/f/41f1c28eaf5a9a565b0250312fa1f546af104412.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{7}{21}&lt;\\frac{9}{23}\\]\" width=\"65\" height=\"38\" />\nTherefore,  our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2dd3030cba2aa9b1cc56249863554d3d4996b902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{5}{19}&lt;\\frac{7}{21}&lt;\\frac{9}{23}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"160\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28quick_and_easy.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(quick_and_easy)\">Solution 3 (quick and easy)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (quick and easy)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/2/532a7d21d6914b742efc7e65443dcea6173d0a3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/0/430973ff3daa8a5bdf2c06c4bf337bc2b2f13c25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{14}{19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> away from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/c/89cb8ea0947d613d3ba24dff185018ca468851bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/9/849ece4302e8cafb84450694704eceef195523ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{14}{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> away from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/f/7ffad955f99e6fe4b457ad9454f5c6f1284a0358.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/b/c1b7380cb02d9b89fe95f0d79bbd3ba622a0976b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{14}{23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> away from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/0/430973ff3daa8a5bdf2c06c4bf337bc2b2f13c25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{14}{19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> is the largest, we know that it is the farthest away from 0, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/b/c1b7380cb02d9b89fe95f0d79bbd3ba622a0976b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{14}{23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> is the smallest, so it is the closest to 0. Therefore,  our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2dd3030cba2aa9b1cc56249863554d3d4996b902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{5}{19}&lt;\\frac{7}{21}&lt;\\frac{9}{23}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"160\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>~monkey_land\nedited by ~NXC\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/7/ab72fa967588bfbf7eb6f24a630578180b21ef99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b}&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"49\" height=\"34\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/f/9dfc685c058a3923bc44dc7a591ea65066c69dea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />. We claim that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/1/0c15c5f80eb8dbc4319324b4c90bd3798f5be4c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b}&lt;\\frac{a+2}{b+2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"85\" height=\"40\" />. Cross-multiplying gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/6/1c6ef2b3d315244800f3c284d55b45677ecb347d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(b+2)&lt;b(a+2)\\Rightarrow ab+2a&lt;ab+2b\\Rightarrow 2a&lt;2b\\Rightarrow a&lt;b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"477\" height=\"20\" />,\nwhich is true.\n</p><p>Since all fractions are less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, this applies here: and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/7/607e13619dae0de704a7466f6e85365a00f83fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{19}&lt;\\frac{7}{21} and \\frac{7}{21}&lt;\\frac{9}{23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"169\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2dd3030cba2aa9b1cc56249863554d3d4996b902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{5}{19}&lt;\\frac{7}{21}&lt;\\frac{9}{23}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"160\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>Note: The value <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is not special, this works for any positive number. Just make sure that the fraction is less than 1 and you add it to both the numerator and denominator.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Just solve <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/2/532a7d21d6914b742efc7e65443dcea6173d0a3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/f/7ffad955f99e6fe4b457ad9454f5c6f1284a0358.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> to 2 or 3 decimal places, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/c/89cb8ea0947d613d3ba24dff185018ca468851bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />. You get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/0/0906fb565a0387acd3f0a795de11c1a48ffef7dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.26$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce4c72e8bf9c1ab84a7a7823016403912b8a272.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" /> respectively, so, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/6/f26ddb99a4a19400ec71b3dc7c69a11bd72b27f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{19}&lt;\\frac{7}{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/0/d80bf51452978485333c9d2672b171e6e3c02fc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{21}&lt;\\frac{9}{23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>hence the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2dd3030cba2aa9b1cc56249863554d3d4996b902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{5}{19}&lt;\\frac{7}{21}&lt;\\frac{9}{23}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"160\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>-N.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/pU1zjw--K8M\">http